# Every variable documented, no secrets (nothing in the frontend bundle is ever secret anyway —
# PROJECT_ARCHITECTURE_FRONTEND.md §18.2).
# Local dev (separate Vite dev server + separate `dotnet run` backend): a full URL.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5280
# Production build (served from the backend's own wwwroot, see .env.production): the special
# value "same-origin" resolves to window.location.origin at runtime instead of a fixed URL.
